    <string name="app_name">Macro Recorder</string>
    <string name="service_label">Macro Recorder (record &amp; play)</string>
    <string name="service_summary">Records screen actions (taps, long presses, swipes) and plays them back automatically later.</string>
    <string name="service_description">This service records the coordinates and timing of taps, long presses and swipes on the screen only while you have pressed Record, and performs the same actions again when you press Play.\n\n[Features used]\n• Performing gestures (to replay recorded actions and to pass your touches through to the app underneath while recording)\n• Buttons shown on top of the screen (Record, Play, Stop)\n\n[How your data is handled]\n• Only finger positions (coordinates) and timing are recorded. The content, text, passwords and personal information of other apps are never read.\n• Recorded macros are stored only inside this app on this device.\n• The app has no internet permission, so no data is ever sent off the device.\n• You can delete macros at any time from the list in the app.</string>
    <string name="privacy_note">Only finger positions and timing are recorded; the screen content of other apps is never read. Data stays on this device only, and the app has no internet permission.</string>
    <string name="tagline">Record taps and swipes, then play them back automatically</string>
